Automated_SiSo_Encrypting_and_storing_configured_and_detected_location_data_into_black_box
    [Documentation]
    ...  The purpose of the test is to check if the geolocation files are present on smod, bbmods and rmods after
    ...  switching on feature flag (CB009077).
    ...  Additionally files should have size greater than zero (smod, bbmod - CB009077-SR-D)
    ...  and rmod files should contain specific elements (CB009077-SR-E).
    ...  Then the feature flag is switched off - files should have size equals to zero (smod, bbmod) and
    ...  rmod files should not contain specific elements.
    ...  Main steps of the test case look like:
    ...    1) creating directories for normal and empty geolocation files
    ...    2) setting actLocInfoStore to True and accLevSet to High
    ...    3) downloading from smod and every bbmod geolocation file (fullrack configs are also supported)
    ...    4) verifying if every file has size greater than zero (geolocation_files directory)
    ...    5) downloading from every rmod geolocation file (fullrack configs are also supported)
    ...    6) verifying if every rmod file contains specific elements (geolocation_files/rmod_geolocation directory)
    ...    7) setting actLocInfoStore to False
    ...    8) downloading from smod and every bbmod geolocation file again (fullrack configs are also supported)
    ...    9) verifying if every file has size equals to zero (geolocation_empty_files directory)
    ...    10) downloading from every rmod geolocation file (fullrack configs are also supported)
    ...    11) verifying if every rmod file does not contain specific elements
    ...        (geolocation_empty_files/rmod_geolocation directory)
    ...  In case of smods without bbmod (e.g. ASOE, ASOH, ASOG) please set with_bbmod flag to False.
    ...  Featuere CB009077-SR-D does not support ABIA bbmod (ignored during the test).
    ...  It is required for BTS configuration to use synchronization via GPS (not TOPP)!
    ...  For featuere CB009077-SR-E it is required to have in SCF modulePositionInformation object for every radio.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param str smod_geolocation_path: (Optional) :
    ...         Path to the geolocation file on smod. Should be set if default location has changed.
    ...         Default value: /ffs/run/config/lifedata
    ...  :param str bbmod_geolocation_path: (Optional) :
    ...         Path to the geolocation file on bbmod. Should be set if default location has changed.
    ...         Default value: /run/blackbox
    ...  :param str rmod_geolocation_path: (Optional) :
    ...         Path to the geolocation file on rmod. Should be set if default location has changed.
    ...         Default value: /mnt/runtime/rfsw/uoam
    ...  :param str string_in_geofile_name: (Optional) :
    ...         Unique string that is in a geolocation filename. Should be set if default filename has changed.
    ...         Default value: geolocation
    ...  :param str rmod_geo_file_name: (Optional) :
    ...         Unique filename which contains geolocation radio info. Should be set if default filename has changed.
    ...         Default value: permanent.xml
    ...  :param str accLevSet: (Optional) :
    ...         Value that will be set for accLevSet parameter.
    ...         Default value: High
    ...  :param bool with_bbmod: (Optional) :
    ...         Should be changed to False in case of smods without bbmod (e.g. ASOE, ASOH, ASOG).
    ...         Default value: True
    ...  :param bool with_rmod: (Optional) :
    ...         Should be changed to False for case when rmod's part should not be checked or for rmods not supporting
    ...         CB009077 feature.
    ...         Default value: True
    [Arguments]                                 ${smod_geolocation_path}=/ffs/run/config/lifedata
    ...                                         ${bbmod_geolocation_path}=/run/blackbox
    ...                                         ${rmod_geolocation_path}=/mnt/runtime/rfsw/uoam
    ...                                         ${string_in_geofile_name}=geolocation
    ...                                         ${rmod_geo_file_name}=permanent.xml
    ...                                         ${accLevSet}=High
    ...                                         ${with_bbmod}=${True}
    ...                                         ${with_rmod}=${True}
    [Timeout]                                   24 hours
    Set Test Variable                           ${return_to_initial_scf}        ${True}

    Robot Log Operation                         Creating path for geolocation files...
    ${geolocation_path}                         Set variable    ${logs_path}/geolocation_files
    logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist             dir_path=${geolocation_path}
    Robot Log Operation                         Creating path for empty geolocation files...
    ${empty_geolocation_path}                   Set variable    ${logs_path}/geolocation_empty_files
    logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist             dir_path=${empty_geolocation_path}

    ${download_path_rmod}=                      Run Keyword If      ${with_rmod}
    ...                                         Set variable    ${logs_path}/geolocation_files/rmod_geolocation
    ${download_path_rmod_empty_location}=       Run Keyword If      ${with_rmod}
    ...                                         Set variable    ${logs_path}/geolocation_empty_files/rmod_geolocation
    Run Keyword If                              ${with_rmod}
    ...                                         Run Keywords
    ...                                         Robot Log Operation
    ...                                         Creating path for radio geolocation files...
    ...                                         AND
    ...                                         logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist
    ...                                         dir_path=${download_path_rmod}
    ...                                         AND
    ...                                         logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist
    ...                                         dir_path=${download_path_rmod_empty_location}

    ${bts_type}=                                hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${is_full_rack_config}=                     hwpta_testline.is_full_rack
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    Create admin session with default alias     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${connection}=                              connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

    config_operations.connect                   alias=${connection}
    Exclude CB009077 Parameters From Prevent Parameters Modification List
    Set CB009077 Feature Parameter To True/False
    ...                                         actLocInfoStore=${True}
    ...                                         accLevSet_value=${accLevSet}

    Download Geolocation Files                  download_path=${geolocation_path}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                         smod_geolocation_path=${smod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         bbmod_geolocation_path=${bbmod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         custom_string=${string_in_geofile_name}
    ...                                         slave_bts=${is_full_rack_config}
    ...                                         with_bbmod=${with_bbmod}
    Verify Size Of Geolocation Files            path_to_files=${geolocation_path}
    ...                                         should_be_zero=${False}
    Run Keyword If                              ${with_rmod}
    ...                                         Run Keywords
    ...                                         Download Geolocation File From Rmods
    ...                                         download_path=${download_path_rmod}
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                         rmod_geolocation_path=${rmod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         rmod_geo_file_name=${rmod_geo_file_name}
    ...                                         AND
    ...                                         Verify Content Of Rmod Geolocation Files
    ...                                         path_to_files=${download_path_rmod}
    ...                                         actLocInfoStore=${True}

    Set CB009077 Feature Parameter To True/False
    ...                                         actLocInfoStore=${False}

    Download Geolocation Files                  download_path=${empty_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                         smod_geolocation_path=${smod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         bbmod_geolocation_path=${bbmod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         custom_string=${string_in_geofile_name}
    ...                                         slave_bts=${is_full_rack_config}
    ...                                         with_bbmod=${with_bbmod}
    Verify Size Of Geolocation Files            path_to_files=${empty_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         should_be_zero=${True}
    Run Keyword If                              ${with_rmod}
    ...                                         Run Keywords
    ...                                         Download Geolocation File From Rmods
    ...                                         download_path=${download_path_rmod_empty_location}
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                         rmod_geolocation_path=${rmod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         rmod_geo_file_name=${rmod_geo_file_name}
    ...                                         AND
    ...                                         Verify Content Of Rmod Geolocation Files
    ...                                         path_to_files=${download_path_rmod_empty_location}
    ...                                         actLocInfoStore=${False}


Set CB009077 Feature Parameter To True/False
    [Documentation]
    ...  Sets value of actLocInfoStore parameter. If actLocInfoStore is set to true, accLevSet parameter is also set.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param bool actLocInfoStore: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Value of actLocInfoStore to be set. (e.g. True, False)
    ...  :param str accLevSet_value: (Optional) :
    ...         Value of accLevSet to be set.
    ...         Default value: High
    [Arguments]                                 ${actLocInfoStore}
    ...                                         ${accLevSet_value}=High
    Run Keyword If                              ${actLocInfoStore}
    ...                                         Run Keywords
    ...                                         Robot Log Operation
    ...                                         Setting accLevSet to ${accLevSet_value}...
    ...                                         AND
    ...                                         config_operations.set_parameter_value
    ...                                         dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
