Download Geolocation Files
    [Documentation]
    ...  Downloads from smod and every bbmod geolocation file (full rack configs are also supported).
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param str download_path: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Path to directory where the geolocation files will be downloaded.
    ...  :param str bts_type: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Type of BTS. (e.g. 'GNB' or 'ENB')
    ...  :param str smod_geolocation_path: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Path to the geolocation file on smod.
    ...  :param str bbmod_geolocation_path: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Path to the geolocation file on bbmod.
    ...  :param str custom_string: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Unique string that is in a geolocation filename.
    ...  :param bool slave_bts: (Mandatory) :
    ...         True - if config with full rack.
    ...         False - if config without full rack
    ...  :param bool with_bbmod: (Optional) :
    ...         Should be changed to False in case of smods without bbmod (e.g. ASOE, ASOH, ASOG).
    ...         Default value: True
    [Arguments]                                 ${download_path}
    ...                                         ${bts_type}
    ...                                         ${smod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         ${bbmod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         ${custom_string}
    ...                                         ${slave_bts}
    ...                                         ${with_bbmod}=${True}
    Robot Log Operation                         Downloading geolocation files...
    Download Geolocation File From Smod         download_path=${download_path}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                         smod_geolocation_path=${smod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         custom_string=${custom_string}
    ...                                         slave_bts=${False}

    Run keyword if                              ${slave_bts}
    ...                                         Download Geolocation File From Smod
    ...                                         download_path=${download_path}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                         smod_geolocation_path=${smod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         custom_string=${custom_string}
    ...                                         slave_bts=${True}

    Run Keyword if                              ${with_bbmod}
    ...                                         Download Geolocation File From BBmods
    ...                                         download_path=${download_path}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                         bbmod_geolocation_path=${bbmod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         custom_string=${custom_string}
    ...                                         slave_bts=${False}

    Run keyword if                              ${slave_bts} and ${with_bbmod}
    ...                                         Download Geolocation File From BBmods
    ...                                         download_path=${download_path}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                         bbmod_geolocation_path=${bbmod_geolocation_path}
    ...                                         custom_string=${custom_string}
    ...                                         slave_bts=${True}


Verify Size Of Geolocation Files
    [Documentation]
    ...  Verifies the size of every geolocation file in specified directory.
    ...  By default size of every file has to be greater than zero.
    ...  If should_be_zero set to True then the size has to be equal to zero.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param str path_to_files: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Path to directory where the geolocation files will be verified.
    ...  :param bool should_be_zero: (Optional) :
    ...         Should be changed to True if verification should check if size of file is equal to zero.
    ...         Default value: False
    [Arguments]                                 ${path_to_files}
    ...                                         ${should_be_zero}=${False}
    Robot Log Operation                         Verifying geolocation files...
    Run keyword if                              ${should_be_zero}
    ...                                         vm.verify_if_all_files_size_is_zero_in_directory
    ...                                         path_to_files=${path_to_files}
    ...                                         ELSE
    ...                                         vm.verify_if_all_files_size_is_greater_than_zero_in_directory
    ...                                         path_to_files=${path_to_files}


Verify Content Of Rmod Geolocation Files
    [Documentation]
    ...  Verifies the content of every rmod geolocation file in specified directory.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param str path_to_files: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Path to directory where the rmod geolocation files will be verified.
    ...  :param bool actLocInfoStore: (Optional) :
    ...         Should be changed to False if files should not contain geolocation objects.
    ...         Default value: True (files are expected to contain geolocation objects)
    [Arguments]                                 ${path_to_files}
    ...                                         ${actLocInfoStore}=${True}
    Robot Log Operation                         Verifying rmods geolocation files...
    geolocation.verify_rmods_geolocation_files
    ...                                         path_to_files=${path_to_files}
    ...                                         act_loc_info_store=${actLocInfoStore}


Exclude CB009077 Parameters From Prevent Parameters Modification List
    [Documentation]
    ...  Excludes CB009077 parameters (actLocInfoStore and accLevSet) from Prevent Parameters Modification List
    @{feature_parameters}=                      Create List     actLocInfoStore         accLevSet
    ${prevent_param_modif_list}=                Get Prevent Parameters Modification List
    ${new_prevent_param_modif_list}=            Remove CB009077 Feature Parameter From Prevent List
    ...                                         prevent_param_modif_list=${prevent_param_modif_list}
    ...                                         feature_parameters=${feature_parameters}

    Run keyword if                              @{prevent_param_modif_list}!=@{new_prevent_param_modif_list}
    ...                                         Run Keywords
    ...                                         Robot Log Operation
    ...                                         Removing feature parameters from prevent parameters modif list...
    ...                                         AND
    ...                                         Update Prevent Parameters Modification List
    ...                                         prevent_param_modif_list=${new_prevent_param_modif_list}


Get Prevent Parameters Modification List
    [Documentation]
    ...  Gets the prevent parameters modification list from the current BTS configuration.
    ...  :return list of str : list of prevent parameters modification from the current BTS configuration
    ${prevent_param_modif_list}=                config_operations.get_parameter_value
    ...                                         dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
    ...                                         param_name=preventParamModifList
    Robot Log Result                            Prevent parameters modification list: ${prevent_param_modif_list}
    ...                                         to_console=${True}
    [Return]                                    ${prevent_param_modif_list}


Remove CB009077 Feature Parameter From Prevent List
    [Documentation]
    ...  Removes given parameter from the prevent parameters modification list in the current BTS configuration.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param list of str prevent_param_modif_list: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Prevent parameters modification list from the current BTS configuration
    ...  :param list of str feature_parameters: (Mandatory) :
    ...         List with names of parameters that will be searched in the prevent parameters modification list
    ...  :return list of str : Prevent parameters modification list without given parameter
    [Arguments]                                 ${prevent_param_modif_list}
    ...                                         ${feature_parameters}
    ${new_prevent_param_modif_list}=            geolocation.remove_geolocation_parameters_from_prevent_list
    ...                                         prevent_param_modif_list=${prevent_param_modif_list}
    ...                                         feature_parameters=${feature_parameters}
    [Return]                                    ${new_prevent_param_modif_list}


Update Prevent Parameters Modification List
    [Documentation]
    ...  Updates the current BTS configuration with new prevent parameters modification list.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param list of str prevent_param_modif_list: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Prevent parameters modification list
    [Arguments]                                 ${prevent_param_modif_list}
    config_operations.set_parameter_value       dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
    ...                                         param_name=preventParamModifList
    ...                                         param_value=${prevent_param_modif_list}
